WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:05.850
Dugukolo tigiw. O ye kurumba ka maana dɔ ye.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:14.946
Sahiliyanfan ye cɛncɛn ni fɔɲɔ ka jamana ye. Dugukolo tɛ foyi di ni kuun t'a la.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:32.306
Dugukolo tigi ye dugutigi fɔlɔw le ye. A b'o sarakabɔyɔrɔw lɔn.

00:00:32.500 --> 00:00:36.420
Dugukolo, i ye nin ta k'a di an ma ka domuni kɛ.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:42.304
N'a ye suman di, a be falen.

00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:09.680
Lon dɔ, sotigi dɔw bɔra dugu wɛrɛ ra ka na kɛrɛ kɛ ni o ta fanga ye.

00:01:14.000 --> 00:01:19.946
U kuntigi lo be dugu kɔnɔ. Mɔgɔ minw tun b'a fɛ ka see sɔrɔ u kan, olu be sigi.

00:01:40.000 --> 00:01:43.610
A b'a ka forow sɛnɛ. Nka dugukolo ma den.

00:01:52.000 --> 00:01:56.202
Fɛɛn si tɛ yiriwa. A ka sotigiw fana be kɔngɔ la.

00:01:56.500 --> 00:02:00.798
Kɔngɔ be ne ka mɔgɔw la. Mun na fɛɛn si tɛ falen?

00:02:16.000 --> 00:02:21.194
A laban, a y'a ɲɛɛ biri dugu ma. A bena taga cɛkɔrɔba fɛ.

00:02:24.000 --> 00:02:26.880
N Faa kɔrɔ, i ka jamana banna ne la.

00:02:27.000 --> 00:02:28.280
A t'i lɔn fɔlɔ.

00:02:31.000 --> 00:02:32.968
A to n' k'i yɛrɛ yira a la.

00:02:49.500 --> 00:02:51.116
An ye bɛnkan dɔ sigi.

00:02:53.500 --> 00:02:57.004
I bɛna kuma mɔgɔw fɛ, ne bɛna kuma dugukolo kan.

00:03:00.000 --> 00:03:03.616
Dugukolo kuntigi kelenpe le bɛ kuma ni sarakabɔnanw ye.

00:03:10.000 --> 00:03:13.136
O ka saraka bɔ ɲɔgɔn fɛ, sanji nana.

00:03:34.000 --> 00:03:35.824
Dugukolo fana b'i lɔn.

00:03:38.000 --> 00:03:43.354
O kɔ, kuntigi dɔ sigira masaya ra; dugukolo tigi yɛrɛ boro.

00:04:06.000 --> 00:04:07.900
Yala ne be se ka danni kɛ wa?

00:04:08.000 --> 00:04:09.936
A wolonwulanan, ne dencɛ.

00:04:12.000 --> 00:04:14.912
Hali bi, kuntigi bɛ jamana kuntigi ɲininka.
